     that a _p_i_p_e only supports a SCHED_MASK, and forces the use of a FIFO
     scheduler (these are for backward compatibility reasons; in fact, inter‐
     nally, a dduummmmyynneett''ss pipe is implemented exactly as above).

     There are two modes of dduummmmyynneett operation: “normal” and “fast”.  The
     “normal” mode tries to emulate a real link: the dduummmmyynneett scheduler en‐
