             be parsed for a packet that matches an existing association.
             This value is enforced to be greater or equal than
             nneett..iinneett..iipp..aalliiaass..ssccttpp..iinniittiiaalliissiinngg__cchhuunnkk__pprroocc__lliimmiitt.  A high
