             Defines when the nnaatt responds to any Out-of-the-Blue (OOTB) pack‐
             ets with ErrorM packets.  An OOTB packet is a packet that arrives
             with no existing association registered in the nnaatt and is not an
             INIT or ASCONF-AddIP packet:

